  "releaseNotes": "### Infrastructure & Dependencies\n\n#### Added\n- Added `AGENTS.md` with project overview.\n\n#### Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where `EnhancedLinq.Shared.Infra` could not be found by consuming projects.\n\n#### Changed\n- Bumped `DotExtensions` from 10.2.1 to 10.3.0\n- Bumped , `Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives` from 10.0.6 to 10.0.7\n- Updated GitHub Actions: `step-security/harden-runner` to v2.19.0 and `NuGet/login` to v1.2.0\n\n### EnhancedLinq.Async\n- Fixed off-by-one error in `ImmediateAsyncLastIndexOfExtensions`\n- Updated `System.Linq.AsyncEnumerable` from 10.0.6 to 10.0.7\n- Updated `Microsoft.Bcl.AsyncInterfaces` from 10.0.6 to 10.0.7",
